        "id": 1407350
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-08-18T12:47:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Some upstream driver also use this ways to trigger user space, like\ndrivers/video/fbdev/uvesafb.c (call_usermodehelper(v86d_path, argv, envp, UMH_WAIT_PROC);)\nvsiv4l2.ko is one our internel driver, it use api call_usermodehelper to trigger one user space daemon at some time node.\nSo i have some confuse that why we enable CONFIG_STATIC_USERMODEHELPER in GKI defconfig, But can\u0027t export to vendor driver to use?",
      "parentUuid": "2bd83b8f_3519b65c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2143,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 2143,
        "endChar": 21
